TI  - Social network disruption as a major factor associated with psychological distress 3 years after the 2004 Niigata–Chuetsu earthquake in Japan
AU  - Mari Oyama
AU  - Kazutoshi Nakamura
AU  - Yuko Suda
AU  - Toshiyuki Someya
JO  - Environmental Health and Preventive Medicine
PY  - 2011
VL  - 17
IS  - 2
SP  - 118
